<wpt lat="43.145572" lon="-79.191214"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Off Road Parking: On the north side of Glendale Ave, 50 m east of Welland Canal. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.136771" lon="-79.193530"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Bert Lowe Side Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
